      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/tarball/v4.0.11",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/zipball/v4.0.11",
      "body": "This release contains important security and bug fixes. All users are encouraged to upgrade. Thanks to our 10 contributors, including 6 first-time contributors.\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Enhancements ✨\n* agents: make AGENTS.md the entry point and tighten repo skills by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5278\n* ci: publish maintenance status and add MAINTAINING.md by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5284\n* rate_limiting: deprecate a burst_capacity below 1 by @zzstoatzz and @sclfcz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5296\n* agents: consolidate PR review guidance by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5297\n* status: unify dashboard and terminal issue ranking by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5300\n* Enable ruff flake8-bandit (S) rules on the library by @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5356\n* Bundle extensions with providers by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5360\n* Expand supported Python CI coverage by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5391\n* docs: credit issue authors in maintainer implementations by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5410\n* enhancement: scan release notes for shared contributor credit by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5433\n### Security 🔒\n* Pass client CLI arguments literally to Windows .cmd wrappers by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5419\n* Build client schema types with create_model and bounded caches by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5413\n* Bound schema nesting before client type conversion by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5434\n* OpenAPI components send only declared arguments and keep configured headers by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5423\n* Use the server's auth provider for component manager routes by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5425\n* Apply Host/Origin protection settings to the SSE transport by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5427\n* Require a startup-URL session for the fastmcp dev apps preview by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5417\n* Apply transforms, enabled state, and auth to hashed tool lookups by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5415\n* Key cached schema adapters by the normalized schema by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5436\n* Resolve injected tools through the server's tool lookup by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5431\n* Keep $ref pointers when inlining would produce an oversized schema by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5421\n### Fixes 🐞\n* rate_limiting: default burst capacity to at least 1 by @zzstoatzz and @Patrick-SCH03 in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5293\n* types: map Image jpg/svg/tif formats to canonical MIME types by @zzstoatzz and @Patrick-SCH03 in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5294\n* client: decode empty structured content into CallToolResult.data by @zzstoatzz and @Patrick-SCH03 in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5291\n* fix: use portable issue ranking cache filenames by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5314\n* fix: validate cached version timestamp types by @Harsh23Kashyap in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5351\n* cli: read MCP and fastmcp.json config files as utf-8 by @zzstoatzz and @asasemahmed in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5345\n* Support Python 3.15 by @Kludex in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5374\n* Revert \"Support Python 3.15\" by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5389\n* examples: handle malformed media links and concurrent Fire TV setup by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5390\n* Fix mounted extension runtime tracking by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5392\n* Fall back to pure Python YAML loader in schema tests by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5395\n* tools: keep explicit Field(title=...) on parameters in the input schema by @zzstoatzz and @TJReinert in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5388\n* Run Windows tests on code pull requests by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5408\n* Avoid repeated traversal of shared tool schema definitions by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5412\n* Keep referenced body fields when a request body schema adds sibling properties by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5440\n* Require pydocket 0.26.0 so a cancelled task cannot stop the worker by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5444\n### Docs 📚\n* docs: consolidate developer and maintainer guidance by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5298\n* examples: add interactive media picker MCP app by @zzstoatzz in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5281\n* docs: route SDK v1 users to the correct upgrade guide by @aritejhg in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5372\n* Clarify app visibility and configurable security guarantees by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5409\n* Clarify declared header parameters in the OpenAPI docs by @jlowin and @strawgate in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5437\n* docs: add v4.0.11 changelog entries by @jlowin in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5446\n### Dependencies 📦\n* chore(deps): bump the uv group across 2 directories with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5361\n### Other Changes 🦾\n* chore(deps): Update astral-sh/setup-uv action to v10.2.0 by @prefect-renovate[bot] in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5347\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Harsh23Kashyap made their first contribution in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5351\n* @aritejhg made their first contribution in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5372\n* @Patrick-SCH03 made their first contribution in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5291\n* @sclfcz made their first contribution in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5296\n* @asasemahmed made their first contribution in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5345\n* @TJReinert made their first contribution in https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/pull/5388\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp/compare/v4.0.10...v4.0.11\n",
      "mentions_count": 11
    }
